# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
#
# Pages serves an existing file first (real prerendered .html, _nuxt assets,
# favicon, robots.txt). Only if nothing matches does it fall through to this
# rule, which rewrites to the Nuxt-generated SPA entry so Vue Router can
# resolve client-side routes like /movie/550, /tv/1399, /watch/tv/1/1/1.
#
# Cloudflare Pages supports SPA fallback via a 200 rewrite to the SPA shell.
# See: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# Priority note: this must be a 200 rewrite (not a 302) so the app boots and
# Vue Router takes over, matching the ssr:false routeRules in nuxt.config.ts.

/*    /index.html   200